114	 * Open an HTML document in a new window/tab and trigger print.
115	 * On iOS: injects a visible toolbar (no auto-print — user taps Imprimir).
116	 * On Android/Desktop: silent auto-print after onload.
117	 *
118	 * The provided html should be a full HTML document (with <html><head><body>).
119	 * If it's a fragment, we'll wrap it.
